---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
// Usando as imagens que sabemos que existem
import print1 from "../../assets/images/Prints/depoimento_ntr_1.png";
import print2 from "../../assets/images/Prints/depoimento_ntr_2.png";
import print3 from "../../assets/images/Prints/depoimento_ntr_3.png";

// Se tiverem mais prints depois, podem ser importados aqui
---

<section class="overflow-hidden bg-[#050505] py-24">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 text-center">
    <div class="reveal-up mb-16">
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white uppercase md:text-5xl">
        NÃO É UM. NÃO SÃO DOIS.
      </h2>
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-brand-red uppercase md:text-6xl">
        SÃO CENTENAS.
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-400">
        Veja o que acontece com a oficina de quem decide parar de apostar na sorte e começa a
        aplicar o método NTR na prática.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Masonry Grid (simulado com colunas do Tailwind) */}
    <div
      class="reveal-up columns-1 gap-6 space-y-6 md:columns-2 lg:columns-3"
      style="transition-delay: 200ms;"
    >
      <div class="break-inside-avoid overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 shadow-xl transition-colors hover:border-brand-red/50">
        <Image src={print1} alt="Depoimento Aluno 1" class="h-auto w-full" />
      </div>

      <div class="break-inside-avoid overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 shadow-xl transition-colors hover:border-brand-red/50">
        <Image src={print2} alt="Depoimento Aluno 2" class="h-auto w-full" />
      </div>

      <div class="break-inside-avoid overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 shadow-xl transition-colors hover:border-brand-red/50">
        <Image src={print3} alt="Depoimento Aluno 3" class="h-auto w-full" />
      </div>

      <div class="break-inside-avoid overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 shadow-xl transition-colors hover:border-brand-red/50">
        <Image src={print1} alt="Depoimento Aluno 4" class="h-auto w-full opacity-80" />
      </div>

      <div class="break-inside-avoid overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 shadow-xl transition-colors hover:border-brand-red/50">
        <Image src={print2} alt="Depoimento Aluno 5" class="h-auto w-full opacity-80" />
      </div>

      <div class="break-inside-avoid overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 shadow-xl transition-colors hover:border-brand-red/50">
        <Image src={print3} alt="Depoimento Aluno 6" class="h-auto w-full opacity-80" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal-up mt-16">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 italic">
        Estes são apenas alguns dos mais de 12.000 alunos transformados.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
